# Third-party notices

This file lists the third-party crates in the dependency graph of the
tpt-planetary workspace, with the licence text supplied by each crate. It is
generated by `cargo about generate about.hbs` from `about.toml`. Do not edit it
by hand; regenerate it after changing dependencies.

Every crate here is accepted by `deny.toml`. Crates that offer a choice of
licences are listed under each licence they are available under.

